    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> you can use either\nthis <code>#checkNotModified(long)</code> method; or\n<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String)</code></a>. If you want to enforce both\na strong entity tag and a Last-Modified value,\nas recommended by the HTTP specification,\nthen you should use <a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String, long)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong>您可以使用此<code>#checkNotModified(long)</code>方法；或<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String)</code></a>。如果您希望同时强制要求强实体标签和 Last-Modified 值（如 HTTP 规范所推荐），则应使用<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String, long)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> you can use either\nthis <code>#checkNotModified(String)</code> method; or\n<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(long)</code></a>. If you want to enforce both\na strong entity tag and a Last-Modified value,\nas recommended by the HTTP specification,\nthen you should use <a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String, long)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong>您可以使用此<code>#checkNotModified(String)</code>方法；或<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(long)</code></a>。如果您想同时强制要求强实体标签和 Last-Modified 值（正如 HTTP 规范所推荐的那样），则应使用<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String, long)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The HTTP specification recommends\nsetting both ETag and Last-Modified values, but you can also\nuse <a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String)</code></a> or\n<a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(long)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> HTTP 规范建议同时设置 ETag 和 Last-Modified 值，但您也可以使用 <a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(String)</code></a> 或 <a href=\"WebRequest.html#checkNotModified(long)\"><code>WebRequest.checkNotModified(long)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieves the first header value in case of a multi-value header.",
      "translation": "在具有多值头的情况下，获取第一个头值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A single-value header will be exposed as an array with a single element.",
      "translation": "单个值头将作为包含单个元素的数组暴露。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieves the first parameter value in case of a multi-value parameter.",
      "translation": "在具有多值参数的情况下，获取第一个参数值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A single-value parameter will be exposed as an array with a single element.",
      "translation": "单个值参数将作为包含单个元素的数组暴露。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This will also transparently set the \"Last-Modified\" response header\nand HTTP status when applicable.",
      "translation": "这还将透明地设置“Last-Modified”响应标头和适用的 HTTP 状态。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method works with conditional GET/HEAD requests, but\nalso with conditional POST/PUT/DELETE requests.",
      "translation": "此方法适用于条件 GET/HEAD 请求，也适用于条件 POST/PUT/DELETE 请求。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the \"If-Modified-Since\" header is set but cannot be parsed\nto a date value, this method will ignore the header and proceed\nwith setting the last-modified timestamp on the response.",
      "translation": "如果设置了\"If-Modified-Since\"标头但无法将其解析为日期值，此方法将忽略该标头并继续设置响应中的最后修改时间戳。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This will also transparently set the \"ETag\" response header\nand HTTP status when applicable.",
      "translation": "这还将透明地设置“ETag”响应标头和适用的 HTTP 状态。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This will also transparently set the \"ETag\" and \"Last-Modified\"\nresponse headers, and HTTP status when applicable.",
      "translation": "这还将透明地设置“ETag”和“Last-Modified”响应头，并在适用时设置 HTTP 状态。",
      "count": 2
    },
