    {
      "source": "whether the request qualifies as not modified,\nallowing to abort request processing and relying on the response\ntelling the client that the content has not been modified",
      "translation": "该请求是否属于“未修改”的情况，从而允许中止请求处理，并依赖响应告知客户端内容未被修改。",
      "count": 2
